repository-code: "https://github.com/analytics-toolworks/eda-vizkit"
url: "https://github.com/analytics-toolworks/eda-vizkit"
license: MIT

abstract: |
  Reusable visualizations for exploratory data analysis. Provides concise,
  high-level Python functions for inspecting distributions, relationships,
  and data quality in tabular data. Works with ordinary pandas DataFrames
  and explicit visualization inputs; it does not clean data, classify
  variables, select analyses, or make analytical decisions. Functions return
  Matplotlib Axes objects, leaving display and composition to the caller.

